Chris Egerton created KAFKA-15428:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: Cluster-wide dynamic log adjustments for Connect
                 Key: KAFKA-15428
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15428
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: New Feature
          Components: KafkaConnect
            Reporter: Chris Egerton
            Assignee: Chris Egerton


[KIP-495|https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-495%3A+Dynamically+Adjust+Log+Levels+in+Connect] added REST APIs to view and adjust the logging levels of Kafka Connect workers at runtime. This has been tremendously valuable (thank you [~wicknicks]!), but one frequently-observed area for improvement is that the API requires a REST request to be issued to each to-be-adjusted worker.

If possible, we should add support for adjusting the logging level of all workers in a cluster with a single REST request.



