> lost -
> > > > such
> > > > > as
> > > > > > > an
> > > > > > > > > availability zone power outage or a server error. The Kaf=
ka
> > > > > > replication
> > > > > > > > > protocol is designed to handle these situations by removi=
ng
> > such
> > > > > > > replicas
> > > > > > > > > from the ISR and only re-adding them once they have caugh=
t
> > up and
> > > > > > > > therefore
> > > > > > > > > recovered any lost data. This prevents replicas that lost
