> and
> > > > > thereby
> > > > > > > > > removing the last copies of the committed records which t=
he
> > > > leader
> > > > > > lost
> > > > > > > > > initially.
> > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > The new KIP will maximize the protection and provides
> > MinISR-1
> > > > > > > tolerance
> > > > > > > > to
