Hi Satish and all,

I wonder if https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14993 should be =
included in the 3.6 release plan. I'm thinking that when implemented, it=
 would be a small, but still a change in the RSM contract: throw an exce=
ption instead of returning an empty InputStream. Maybe it should be incl=
uded right away to save the migration later? What do you think?

Best,
Ivan

