    Resolution: Fixed

> KRaft migration record counts in log message are incorrect
> ----------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-15435
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15435
>             Project: Kafka
