>
>
> The counting logic in MigrationManifest is incorrect and produces invalid=
 output. This information is critical for users wanting to validate the res=
ult of a migration.
> =C2=A0
> {code}
> Completed migration of metadata from ZooKeeper to KRaft. 7117 records wer=
e generated in 54253 ms across 1629 batches. The record types were {TOPIC_R=
ECORD=3D2, CONFIG_RECORD=3D2, PARTITION_RECORD=3D2, ACCESS_CONTROL_ENTRY_RE=
CORD=3D2, PRODUCER_IDS_RECORD=3D1}.=20
> {code}
> Due to the logic bug, the counts will never exceed 2.



