>>>>>>>> and will
>>>>>>>>>        not have memtables flushed at all , unless RocksDB decides to
>>>>>>>> flush them on
>>>>>>>>>        its own. Checkpointing stores and force-flushing their
>> memtables
>>>>>>>> is only
>>>>>>>>>        done when a Task is being closed.
