             Summary: Add RemoteStorageInterruptedException
                 Key: KAFKA-15480
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15480
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
          Components: core
    Affects Versions: 3.6.0
            Reporter: Mital Awachat


Introduce `RemoteStorageInterruptedException` to propagate interruptions fr=
om the plugin to Kafka without generated (false) errors.=C2=A0

It allows the plugin to notify Kafka an API operation in progress was inter=
rupted as a result of task cancellation, which can happen under changes suc=
h as leadership migration or topic deletion.



