1. Auto-commits would only work with approach 1 in the KIP. Any async=20
solution is incompatible with auto-commits. Do you think the text will=20
improve when this is mentioned?

2. That is entirely correct. If you use async commits you can await=20
completion by doing a single sync commit with an empty offsets Map (this=20
will work as of Kafka 3.6.0).

Is there anything I can do to make the text clearer?

