ava11-ubuntu/Dockerfile#L19>
>>    further increases our confidence in their dependability(Will make thi=
s
>>    change in the KIP).
>>
>> Yes, eclipse-temurin looks like a good choice to me. Nice size reduction=
!
>
>>
