Thanks, Ismael.  I think you are proposing a pair of mutually exclusive args=
 --process.roles and --node.id, right?  I agree that is more user-friendly t=
han the --required-config arg, and it comes at the possible expense of gener=
ality.  So that=E2=80=99s the tradeoff between the two, I think.  No other c=
onfig comes to mind now that we=E2=80=99ve identified these two.  I think th=
e two specific and mutually exclusive parameters would be the way to go unle=
ss someone else identifies still more options that people might want.

Did I get that right, or were you proposing something different?

Ron

